  "about": "Shared test vectors for docs/sync-contract.md. iOS (CorosKit/Tests/CorosKitTests/SyncBodiesTests.swift) and Android build each body from the listed input and must get exactly `body`; both decode every `watchChanges` entry and encode it back to the same JSON. Times are seconds since 2001-01-01T00:00:00Z. Extend this file rather than keeping platform copies.",
